Nabla_Text_StevenItsLatios:
	.string "STEVEN: Wait… that cry!\n"
	.string "It's LATIOS!\p"
	.string "It's said to be very intelligent.\n"
	.string "It can even understand people.\p"
	.string "It looks restless…\n"
	.string "I think it's asking us for help.$"

Nabla_Text_StevenLetsFollowLatios:
	.string "STEVEN: Something must be happening\n"
	.string "to its home.\p"
	.string "{PLAYER}{KUN}, let's go with LATIOS.\n"
	.string "I would like to see this for myself.$"

Nabla_Text_LatiosCarriesYou:
	.string "LATIOS lowered itself so you and\n"
	.string "STEVEN could climb onto its back…$"

Nabla_Text_MattSouthernIsland:
	.string "MATT: Bwahahaha! Look who's back!\n"
	.string "And it brought some friends!\p"
	.string "This island is where the EON POKéMON\n"
	.string "rest. Their power belongs to the sea…\p"
	.string "And the sea belongs to TEAM AQUA!$"

Nabla_Text_StevenLetsBattleTogether:
	.string "STEVEN: So TEAM AQUA is behind this.\p"
	.string "{PLAYER}{KUN}, let's battle them together.\n"
	.string "I'll be right beside you!$"

Nabla_Text_StevenChooseYourPokemon:
	.string "STEVEN: We can't let them get away\n"
	.string "with this. Choose your POKéMON!$"

Nabla_Text_MattDefeat:
	.string "Bwahaha! Now THAT was a battle!$"

Nabla_Text_GruntDefeat:
	.string "No way! The ADMIN and me, beaten?$"

Nabla_Text_MattRetreat:
	.string "MATT: Tch… Fine, you win this round.\p"
	.string "TEAM AQUA, fall back!\n"
	.string "We'll be back for those POKéMON!$"

Nabla_Text_StevenLatiosWantsToJoin:
	.string "STEVEN: LATIOS is safe, thanks to you.\p"
	.string "…Oh? It seems LATIOS wants to come\n"
	.string "with you, {PLAYER}{KUN}.$"

Nabla_Text_PlayerReceivedLatios:
	.string "{PLAYER} received LATIOS!$"

Nabla_Text_StevenLatiosite:
	.string "STEVEN: Look, LATIOS is holding a\n"
	.string "stone. It's a LATIOSITE.\p"
	.string "It's a MEGA STONE, and I have just\n"
	.string "what you need to use it.$"

Nabla_Text_StevenExplainMegaEvolution:
	.string "STEVEN: That's a MEGA BRACELET.\n"
	.string "It holds a KEY STONE.\p"
	.string "When a POKéMON holds its MEGA STONE,\n"
	.string "the KEY STONE lets it MEGA EVOLVE\l"
	.string "in battle.\p"
	.string "Only trainers who share a strong bond\n"
	.string "with their POKéMON can do this.\p"
	.string "Let's head back. LATIOS can fly us to\n"
	.string "ROUTE 118. We'll meet again, {PLAYER}{KUN}.$"
